 Karpin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610030001" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span> - (&quot;Flight of the Bumblecrits&quot;) Commander: weizhong</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>October 2020 Flight Officers:</strong></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3352053&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610030001" alt="Cerastes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3352053)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" >Cerastes</a></span> - Commander: KaraKatt<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1787775&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610030001" alt="Riemann" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1787775)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" >Riemann</a></span> - Commander: Naveil</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>November 2020 Flight Officers:</strong></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ethanhanson" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4465845&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610030001" alt="EthanHanson" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4465845)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ethanhanson" >EthanHanson</a></span> - Commander: KaraKatt<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thealienbaby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4874276&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610030001" alt="TheAlienBaby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4874276)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thealienbaby" >TheAlienBaby</a></span> - Commander: Zyn<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394686&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610030001" alt="forbiddenquest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394686)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" >forbiddenquest</a></span> - Commander: Nagiros</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610030001" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-359511-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Generally correct grammar, mechanics, formatting</div> </div> 
