&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;jeverwood@scp.int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;hcole@scp.int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;RE:SCP-5057&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Harry,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I checked with my assistant and he says nothing out of the norm occurred to SCP-5057 during its time here. Sorry we could not be of further assistance to your research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regards,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr. J. Everwood&lt;br /&gt;
GoI-466 Research Lead&lt;br /&gt;
Secure, Contain, Protect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/SCP_icon%281%29.png) top right no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 3px #444444; width: 85%; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);&quot;&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;align:left; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;hcole@scp.int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;jeverwood@scp.int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;SCP-5057&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I believe you should question your assistant again regarding the attached document.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-good-ending/smudge.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;smudge.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr. H. Cole&lt;br /&gt;
GoI-563 Research Lead&lt;br /&gt;
Secure, Contain, Protect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;BEGIN LOG&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Hi, fifty-fifty-seven. How are you feeling?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; The same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; I&#039;m sorry you&#039;re not feeling well, but I&#039;d like to talk to you about what happened.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher Rex, how did he treat you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Rex was friend. Yeah. Good friend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Then why did you do that to the portrait of you two?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;[Dr. Cole points to the portrait of Researcher Rex and SCP-5057.]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; I am not wanting to talk about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Was he cruel to you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; What is cruel?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Hmm. Being cruel is like being really mean and unfriendly to someone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;[There is a ten-second silence.]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes. He was of being cruel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; What did he do?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; He made me feel toxic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; I see. For what it&#039;s worth, I don&#039;t think you&#039;re toxic to talk to, fify-fifty-seven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Really?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Yeah. You seem like an alright person who was mistreated and lead to believe something that isn&#039;t true.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; But I am still toxic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; You may be toxic to eat, but you are not a toxic person. If anything, I believe Researcher Rex is the real toxic person here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; I am&amp;#8230; not toxic?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; No. You&#039;re you. And that&#039;s perfectly fine. You know, a real friend wouldn&#039;t make you feel toxic. A real friend cares about what you have to say and actually listens to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; I am me&amp;#8230; I am not knowing of what to say.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#039;t need to say anything. Why don&#039;t you go ahead and paint something new? I have to get in contact with someone about something.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;END LOG&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;background: url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/SCP_icon%281%29.png) top right no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 3px #444444; width: 85%; padding: 1px 15px; margin: auto; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);&quot;&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;align:left; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;jeverwood@scp.int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;hcole@scp.int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align:right&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;td&gt;RE:SCP-5057&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Harry,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My assistant said he is familiar with the portrait but reports no unusual events surrounding it. However, he seemed rather uncomfortable about the situation and appeared apprehensive to answer. Therefore I will be personally combing through the logs of all recorded interactions between SCP-5057 and my assistant. I will report any findings to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regards,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dr. J. Everwood&lt;br /&gt;
GoI-466 Research Lead&lt;br /&gt;
Secure, Contain, Protect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;BEGIN LOG&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Hello, fifty-fifty-seven.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Hello! I am of feeling very very good.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; That&#039;s great! What turned your mood around?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; I spend time wondering &#039;what if I is make people toxic?&#039; But you are say I am not toxic, only to eat. I am perfectly fine you say! So I spend time wondering &#039;what if what Doctor Cole are say is right?&#039; And then I feel good. I have not feel good since Rex was friend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Heh. I&#039;m glad you&#039;re feeling better then. By the way, I think you&#039;ll be receiving something from your old &#039;friend&#039; Rex.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Why is?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Just call it a hunch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay, I is calling it hunch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; So do you want to show me what you painted today?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes! Behold!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;[SCP-5054 steps towards a canvas towards the back of its containment chamber and returns with with it, handing it to Dr. Cole.]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Very nice. Are you done with it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Perfect. Why don&#039;t I hang it up for you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;[Dr. Cole proceeds to place the canvas on the wall, hung by a present nail.]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; There we go. So, now that we&#039;ve got that out of the way, why don&#039;t we talk a little about Professor Funtastic?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay, but I ask one thing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; What is it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Can you be of calling me &#039;Taste&#039;?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cole:&lt;/strong&gt; Anything you want, Taste.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5057:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay. I be telling you everything I know now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;END LOG&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5057 was questioned for 2 hours following this interaction but was unable to provide any information on Professor Funtastic. Further research is currently pending.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
