&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;NOTICE OF DISCIPLINARY WARNING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This notice indicates that I, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;REX ALCES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, have been informed by &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: green&quot;&gt;THE ETHICS COMMITTEE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt; of recent rule-breaking behavior. I, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;REX ALCES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, agree to not repeat this behavior under threat of further disciplinary action.&lt;/p&gt;
