&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$250 Reward&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Last spotted on September 16th near Hyde Park&lt;br /&gt;
Very friendly and playful, loves to play chase&lt;br /&gt;
Responds to &amp;quot;Goldie&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If found, please call 306-555-4417&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Please help us find our baby&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
